gate: CLOSED
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:frontend
task: S19 T13 — Focused field stays visible; unsaved edits ask
sprint: S19
dep: S19-T12-installer-copy-hides-opcodes.pd
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md
invariants: ../S19-INVARIANTS.md

context: |
  First ship is a phone. Session fields (password, vehicle, lengths) must
  scroll into view on focus so the keyboard and bottom chrome do not cover
  them. Prove the focus behavior in Vitest (scroll into view); do not claim
  a device keyboard pass. If the form differs from the last read and the
  user leaves the session, ask before discard. Discard writes nothing.
  Stay does not navigate. Web + FakeBle. Package manager: bun.

out:
  - focus scroll on session fields
  - leave-session guard when edits are unwritten
  - co-located tests

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - Focusing a session field scrolls it into view
  - Leave with edits asks; discard sends no write
  - Leave with a clean form does not ask
  - `bun run test` passes
